# Build artifacts and binaries
*.o
*.obj
*.exe
*.a
*.lib
*.ppm
bin/
build/
Projects/**/bin/
Projects/**/build/
Scratchpad/GenerateDialogueProofs
Scratchpad/GenerateFontSectionProofs
Scratchpad/GenerateThemeSectionProofs
Scratchpad/GenerateCarouselProofs
Scratchpad/GenerateControlPanelProof
Scratchpad/VectorGlyphTest
.DS_Store

# Per-user Control Centre preferences (written by ConfigurationRegistry at runtime)
Projects/*/Content/Slate.config.toml

# Fetched test levels (Projects/Project-Zero/Build/FetchSponza.ps1) - never committed
Projects/*/Content/Scenes/Sponza/
Projects/*/Content/Scenes/ShaderBall.gltf
Scratchpad/InterfaceRasterTest

# Compiled shaders (produced by ToolchainSequence / CompileInterfaceShaders.sh)
*.spv

# Generated on first run by GameExecution (--scene showroom). CornellBox.gltf stays tracked as the
#    bit-identity reference; the showroom is derived from ShowroomStructure.cpp and regenerates.
Projects/Project-Zero/Content/Scenes/Showroom.gltf
Projects/Project-Zero/Content/Scenes/ShowroomDrop.gltf
# A8: regenerated on first run by --scene outdoor, same as the two above.
Projects/Project-Zero/Content/Scenes/Outdoor.gltf

# Jolt static library and Project-Physics build output (derived; rebuilt by Scripts/BuildJolt.sh and the toolchain scripts)
ExternalPackages/jolt/lib/
Projects/Project-Physics/Build/Output/
Diagnostics/ProjectPhysics_TelemetryReport*.md

# SolidArc build output (ParametricSketcher has its own standalone CMake project)
Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/build/
Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/Output/
# Sandbox-only g++ build script (kept for re-builds when cmake is unavailable, not part of the project)
Editor/EditorTools/ParametricSketcher/build_gpp.sh

# Project-Dyno / Phase A acoustics: build output and rendered audio (regenerate with --render); logs + PNG proofs are committed
Projects/*/Build/Output/
Scratchpad/*.wav
Diagnostics/ProjectDyno_TelemetryReport*.md

# Repository-root Build\ mirror written by Project-Zero's ToolchainSequence.ps1 (exe + pdb + glfw3.dll + SPIR-V)
/Build/

# Phase A acoustics: third-party reference clips fetched by Scratchpad/AcousticLaFerrariReference.js --fetch (no licence) - never committed
Scratchpad/LaFerrariReference/
